      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>Today is the last day of your sentence.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "Stone cell wall, tally marks, the last one not yet drawn"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>Three weeks ago you were caught with your hand in a stranger’s coin purse. This might have gone unnoticed if you hadn’t been in a bush at the time.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "media",
        items: [
          {
            type: "placeholder",
            caption: "Outside, bush next to an open-air shop, meeting the wall of a wooden house. Late afternoon. The cat reaches out of the bush and pickpockets a passing stranger, her tail sticking out the back. A guard in the background has noticed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>You had been in that bush for most of the afternoon, tail sticking out the back, waiting for a purse to wander close enough. The guards said your technique, judgment, and choice of foliage would always hold you back.</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "text",
        html: [
          "<p>...But you have a new plan!</p>"
        ]
      },
      {
        type: "next",
        page: 2
      }
    ]
